# .helmcheckignore — check-helm-values-keys.sh baseline for observability/langfuse
# (langfuse/langfuse chart, pinned in kustomization.yaml).
#
# One key path per line; `#` comments and blanks ignored. An entry `a.b`
# acknowledges `a.b` and every key nested under it (`a.b.*`). Suppressed keys
# no longer flag, so future commits surface only NEW unknown keys.
#
# Classification method: `grep -rn '.Values.<key>' observability/langfuse/charts/*/`.
# Chart reads it → back-compat-OK. Chart never reads it → genuine wrong-key (DROPPED).

# ── Back-compat-OK ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The chart's templates DO consume these (list-item subpaths / empty-dict
# `resources` toYaml); they render correctly. Safe to suppress.
langfuse.web.pod.additionalEnv       # chart: `range .Values.langfuse.web.pod.additionalEnv`
langfuse.web.pod.additionalEnvFrom   # chart consumes additionalEnvFrom list
langfuse.web.resources               # chart: `toYaml .Values.langfuse.web.resources`
langfuse.worker.pod.additionalEnv    # chart consumes worker additionalEnv list
langfuse.worker.resources            # chart: `toYaml .Values.langfuse.worker.resources`
s3.persistence                       # `.Values.s3` is consumed (bundled MinIO subchart)

# ── KNOWN WRONG-KEYS — value is DROPPED at render (NOT back-compat-OK) ───────
# Acknowledged here ONLY so the hook stays green and flags NEW drift. These are
# TRACKED BUGS: fix the key in values.yaml, then DELETE the line. Right-hand
# side = the key the chart actually reads. (securityContext/containerSecurityContext
# are the existing TODO "langfuse containerSecurityContext / securityContext
# chart-key fix" item; the other three were confirmed dropped during this audit.)
containerSecurityContext   # chart: `langfuse.securityContext` (container-level, NESTED under langfuse:)
securityContext            # chart: `langfuse.podSecurityContext` (pod-level, NESTED under langfuse:)
langfuse.telemetry         # chart: `langfuse.features.telemetryEnabled` — telemetry NOT disabled today
redis.primary              # langfuse `redis:` has no `primary`; bitnami-style persistence/resources are DROPPED
serviceMonitor             # not in chart; no ServiceMonitor is created from these keys
